# Build output and local IDE state
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/TestResults/
*.user
*.suo
# Local executable/debugging profile for the API library.
/StoneForge.API/Properties/launchSettings.json
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
/artifacts/
/build/.thirdparty/
# Local game data and diagnostics must not be published
*.win
*.win.*
*.log
/StoneForge.API/GameData/
